. Désormais chargé de protéger les joyaux de la couronne britannique, il est rapidement confronté à Pascal Sauvage (John Malkovich), un milliardaire mégalomane aux intentions royales. Accompagné de son fidèle assistant Bough (Ben Miller) et de la mystérieuse Lorna Campbell (Natalie Imbruglia), English enchaîne les maladresses et les plans ratés… mais pourrait bien, contre toute attente, sauver le royaume.','127.0.0.1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/143.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-01-12 11:09:24.644','2026-01-12 11:09:24.644',NULL,NULL),(296,1,13,4938,NULL,NULL,'CheminImage','uploads/images/1767866686029.webp','uploads/video/4938/affiche/affiche_1768216432682_s7can0.webp',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/143.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-01-12 11:13:52.704','2026-01-12 11:13:52.704',NULL,NULL),(297,1,13,4941,NULL,NULL,'CheminImage','uploads/video/4941/affiche/affiche.webp','uploads/video/4941/affiche/affiche_1768216566553_kn4pyr.webp',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/143.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-01-12 11:16:06.581','2026-01-12 11:16:06.581',NULL,NULL),(298,1,13,4941,NULL,NULL,'CheminImage','uploads/video/4941/affiche/affiche_1768216566553_kn4pyr.webp','uploads/video/4941/affiche/affiche_1768216602833_ckgizk.webp',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/143.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-01-12 11:16:42.863','2026-01-12 11:16:42.863',NULL,NULL),(299,1,13,4941,NULL,NULL,'CheminImage','uploads/video/4941/affiche/affiche_1768216602833_ckgizk.webp','uploads/video/4941/affiche/affiche_1768216712816_n1n9bu.webp',NULL,'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/143.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-01-12 11:18:32.849','2026-01-12 11:18:32.849',NULL,NULL),(300,1,13,4941,NULL,NULL,'CheminImag