ermination quasi totale de l’humanité. Mais l’arrivée mystérieuse de Marcus Wright (Sam Worthington), un condamné à mort dont le passé cache un secret troublant, bouleverse l’équilibre fragile du conflit. Entre trahison, sacrifice et révélation, Connor devra décider s’il peut faire confiance à cet homme lié aux machines. Alors que Skynet prépare une offensive décisive, l’espoir de la survie humaine repose sur une alliance improbable… et sur le destin d’un futur leader encore en construction.','178.132.106.203','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:147.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/147.0',NULL,'2026-02-19 08:40:53.503','2026-02-19 08:40:53.503',NULL,NULL),(642,2,13,5234,NULL,NULL,'GenreIDs','[]','[1,36,21,46,32,11]','178.132.106.203','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:147.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/147.0','{\"added\": [1, 36, 21, 46, 32, 11], \"removed\": []}','2026-02-19 08:41:20.134','2026-02-19 08:41:20.134',NULL,NULL),(643,2,13,5234,NULL,NULL,'CheminImage','uploads/video/5234/affiche/affiche.webp','uploads/video/5234/affiche/affiche_1771490525779_ovpl0b.webp','178.132.106.203','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:147.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/147.0',NULL,'2026-02-19 08:42:05.790','2026-02-19 08:42:05.790',NULL,NULL),(644,5,15,5220,NULL,NULL,'player',NULL,'play','192.168.1.254','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','{\"serverTime\": \"2026-02-19T08:51:34.845Z\"}','2026-02-19 08:51:34.850','2026-02-19 08:51:34.850',NULL,NULL),(645,5,15,5220,NULL,NULL,'player',NULL,'play','192.168.1.254','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36','{\"serverTime\": \"2026-02-19T12:30:43.746Z\"}','2026-02-19 12:30:43.750','2026-02-19 12:30:43.750',NULL,NULL),(646,5,15,962,37,60,'player',NULL,'play','192.168.1.254','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari