i (Sigourney Weaver), Lo’ak (Britain Dalton) et leurs alliés devront affronter des ennemis aussi bien extérieurs qu’intérieurs. Dans un Pandora plus sombre et dangereux que jamais, l’équilibre entre les peuples Na’vi est menacé, tandis que le colonel Miles Quaritch (Stephen Lang) poursuit son implacable quête de domination.','uploads/video/5496/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5496/affiche/affiche_1781733934243_hq0d8g.webp',1,NULL,'2026-04-01 08:47:27.780',2,1),(5497,'Rolls Royce Ghost Series II by Novitec',NULL,'uploads/video/5497/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5497/affiche/affiche.webp',1,334,'2026-04-10 15:42:15.648',2,0),(5498,'Rolls Royce Ghost II Series II Exhaust-System with Flap-Regulation by Spofec',NULL,'uploads/video/5498/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5498/affiche/affiche.webp',1,334,'2026-04-10 15:45:26.165',2,0),(5499,'#01',NULL,'uploads/video/5499/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5499/affiche/affiche.webp',1,335,'2026-04-15 09:48:56.761',2,0),(5500,'#02',NULL,'uploads/video/5500/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5500/affiche/affiche.webp',1,335,'2026-04-15 09:56:23.464',2,0),(5501,'#03',NULL,'uploads/video/5501/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5501/affiche/affiche.webp',1,335,'2026-04-15 10:11:36.807',2,0),(5502,'#05',NULL,'uploads/video/5502/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5502/affiche/affiche.webp',1,335,'2026-04-15 10:29:16.113',2,0),(5503,'#06',NULL,'uploads/video/5503/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5503/affiche/affiche.webp',1,335,'2026-04-15 11:01:22.961',2,0),(5504,'#04',NULL,'uploads/video/5504/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5504/affiche/affiche.webp',1,335,'2026-04-15 11:21:39.177',2,0),(5505,'#07',NULL,'uploads/video/5505/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5505/affiche/affiche.webp',1,335,'2026-04-15 11:22:59.133',2,0),(5506,'#09',NULL,'uploads/video/5506/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5506/affiche/affiche.webp',1,301,'2026-04-15 11:53:12.976',2,0),(5507,'#10',NULL,'uploads/video/5507/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5507/affiche/affiche.webp',1