es spatiales et découvertes merveilleuses, Mario devra prouver que même au cœur de l’infini, le courage et l’amitié restent les plus grandes forces de l’univers. Une aventure spectaculaire où chaque étoile cache un nouveau défi.  ','uploads/video/5553/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5553/affiche/affiche_1781734163284_w185ke.webp',1,NULL,'2026-05-08 22:37:26.493',2,1),(5554,'#06',NULL,'uploads/video/5554/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5554/affiche/affiche.webp',1,341,'2026-05-09 12:23:14.636',2,0),(5555,'#08',NULL,'uploads/video/5555/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5555/affiche/affiche.webp',1,341,'2026-05-09 12:25:43.193',2,0),(5556,'#07',NULL,'uploads/video/5556/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5556/affiche/affiche.webp',1,341,'2026-05-09 12:28:22.323',2,0),(5557,'#01',NULL,'uploads/video/5557/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5557/affiche/affiche.webp',1,342,'2026-05-09 15:07:20.771',2,0),(5558,'#02',NULL,'uploads/video/5558/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5558/affiche/affiche.webp',1,342,'2026-05-09 16:02:13.893',2,0),(5559,'#03',NULL,'uploads/video/5559/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5559/affiche/affiche.webp',1,342,'2026-05-09 18:43:31.838',2,0),(5560,'#04',NULL,'uploads/video/5560/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5560/affiche/affiche.webp',1,342,'2026-05-10 11:26:12.069',2,0),(5561,'#05',NULL,'uploads/video/5561/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5561/affiche/affiche.webp',1,342,'2026-05-10 12:18:27.575',2,0),(5562,'#06',NULL,'uploads/video/5562/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5562/affiche/affiche.webp',1,342,'2026-05-10 13:03:08.762',2,0),(5563,'#07',NULL,'uploads/video/5563/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5563/affiche/affiche.webp',1,342,'2026-05-10 13:44:12.184',2,0),(5564,'#01',NULL,'uploads/video/5564/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5564/affiche/affiche.webp',1,343,'2026-05-10 18:20:01.756',2,0),(5565,'#02',NULL,'uploads/video/5565/hls/master.m3u8','uploads/video/5565/affiche/affiche.webp',1,343,'2026-05-10 18:34:44.154',2,0),(5566,'#08',NULL,'uploads/video/55